    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731550/extras/92e352fa1d67c6267e78b57661d2ede3.poster.avif?t=1752442653\" width=800 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731550/extras/92e352fa1d67c6267e78b57661d2ede3.webm?t=1752442653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731550/extras/92e352fa1d67c6267e78b57661d2ede3.mp4?t=1752442653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Are you afraid of the dark? What about being out of breath?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A horror game in the unlit depths of the ocean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together with your friends, you will try to complete the mission, sometimes you have to escape and sometimes you don't. Make sure to do one thing, breathe...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731550/extras/bffd2575f8f58664bc6711f7668ed2c7.poster.avif?t=1752442653\" width=608 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731550/extras/bffd2575f8f58664bc6711f7668ed2c7.webm?t=1752442653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731550/extras/bffd2575f8f58664bc6711f7668ed2c7.mp4?t=1752442653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731550/extras/8eaf9af55ea729349a5aab6d30d05c7d.poster.avif?t=1752442653\" width=800 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731550/extras/8eaf9af55ea729349a5aab6d30d05c7d.webm?t=1752442653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731550/extras/8eaf9af55ea729349a5aab6d30d05c7d.mp4?t=1752442653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Find and destroy energy cubes to stop the secret organization's experiments. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't get lost in the dark and deep waters. Don't get caught! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731550/extras/e9de55ce409739f595c15afe49aaa346.poster.avif?t=1752442653\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731550/extras/e9de55ce409739f595c15afe49aaa346.webm?t=1752442653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731550/extras/e9de55ce409739f595c15afe49aaa346.mp4?t=1752442653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731550/extras/722ee3a53ad34261c4110390f46090b9.poster.avif?t=1752442653\" width=800 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731550/extras/722ee3a53ad34261c4110390f46090b9.webm?t=1752442653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731550/extras/722ee3a53ad34261c4110390f46090b9.mp4?t=1752442653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>According to a legend, creatures from another universe traveled to planets and started experimenting with the creatures in that region to increase their qualified population. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They left the planets with unsuccessful results.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, years later, mutated creatures began to come to life from the genes that were experimented on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some people who realized this immediately went after this power and found a cube that was not from this world. They began to conduct top-secret and illegal experiments to access the power. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731550/extras/3d42a9a09267de0854f5aa64942f4e71.poster.avif?t=1752442653\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731550/extras/3d42a9a09267de0854f5aa64942f4e71.webm?t=1752442653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731550/extras/3d42a9a09267de0854f5aa64942f4e71.mp4?t=1752442653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731550/extras/92e352fa1d67c6267e78b57661d2ede3.poster.avif?t=1752442653\" width=800 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731550/extras/92e352fa1d67c6267e78b57661d2ede3.webm?t=1752442653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731550/extras/92e352fa1d67c6267e78b57661d2ede3.mp4?t=1752442653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Are you afraid of the dark? What about being out of breath?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A horror game in the unlit depths of the ocean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together with your friends, you will try to complete the mission, sometimes you have to escape and sometimes you don't. Make sure to do one thing, breathe...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731550/extras/bffd2575f8f58664bc6711f7668ed2c7.poster.avif?t=1752442653\" width=608 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731550/extras/bffd2575f8f58664bc6711f7668ed2c7.webm?t=1752442653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731550/extras/bffd2575f8f58664bc6711f7668ed2c7.mp4?t=1752442653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731550/extras/8eaf9af55ea729349a5aab6d30d05c7d.poster.avif?t=1752442653\" width=800 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731550/extras/8eaf9af55ea729349a5aab6d30d05c7d.webm?t=1752442653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731550/extras/8eaf9af55ea729349a5aab6d30d05c7d.mp4?t=1752442653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Find and destroy energy cubes to stop the secret organization's experiments. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't get lost in the dark and deep waters. Don't get caught! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731550/extras/e9de55ce409739f595c15afe49aaa346.poster.avif?t=1752442653\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731550/extras/e9de55ce409739f595c15afe49aaa346.webm?t=1752442653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731550/extras/e9de55ce409739f595c15afe49aaa346.mp4?t=1752442653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731550/extras/722ee3a53ad34261c4110390f46090b9.poster.avif?t=1752442653\" width=800 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731550/extras/722ee3a53ad34261c4110390f46090b9.webm?t=1752442653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731550/extras/722ee3a53ad34261c4110390f46090b9.mp4?t=1752442653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>According to a legend, creatures from another universe traveled to planets and started experimenting with the creatures in that region to increase their qualified population. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They left the planets with unsuccessful results.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, years later, mutated creatures began to come to life from the genes that were experimented on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some people who realized this immediately went after this power and found a cube that was not from this world. They began to conduct top-secret and illegal experiments to access the power. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731550/extras/3d42a9a09267de0854f5aa64942f4e71.poster.avif?t=1752442653\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731550/extras/3d42a9a09267de0854f5aa64942f4e71.webm?t=1752442653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731550/extras/3d42a9a09267de0854f5aa64942f4e71.mp4?t=1752442653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
